# Audio Streaming (iOS)

Audio is an experimental Camera Stream extension. Require camera and microphone permission, set a non-nil PCM `audioCodec`, register `audioFramePublisher` before starting Stream, and use frame timestamps. Cancel the listener before stopping Camera. MockDeviceKit does not promise deterministic PCM delivery.
